<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers slow, fully $1.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4, 1050-1350 lbs 67.00-68.50. Select 62.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter heifers: Select to largely Choice 2-4, 975-1250 lbs 67.00-68.50. Select 62.00-66.50.</p>
</text>
